        <div class="section-head"><div class="section-kicker">Scope at a glance</div><h2 class="section-title">Know what changes at each level.</h2><p class="section-copy">The paid path separates diagnosis, creation, maintenance, and active improvement so the commitment stays legible.</p></div>
        <div class="comparison-wrap">
          <table class="comparison-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Capability</th><th scope="col">Snapshot</th><th scope="col">Build</th><th scope="col">Maintenance</th><th scope="col">Managed</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Customer fact confirmation</td><td>Baseline</td><td><span class="included" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td><td>As changed</td><td><span class="included" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>VizAI owner approval</td><td>Deliverable</td><td>Canon + publish</td><td>Exceptions</td><td>External actions</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Selected AI-system testing</td><td><span class="included" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td><td>Baseline</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Bi-weekly</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Canonical profile and JSON record</td><td><span class="excluded" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td><span class="included" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td><td>Maintained</td><td>Maintained</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Relevant website structured data</td><td><span class="excluded" aria-label="Not included">—</span></td><td><span class="included" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td><td>Small correction</td><td>Implementation tasks</td></tr>
